   "corrections": [],
   "notes": "Complete standard BG-11 recipe is given verbatim in the paper's Methods, including the full trace-metals solution (B, Mn, Zn, Mo, Cu, Co) added at 1 mL/L, so trace-element concentrations are the stock values divided by 1000. Boron and the carbonate/EDTA/citrate chelator system were absent from current_components and are now added. Ferric ammonium citrate has undefined stoichiometry (concentration_mM null); it supplies both the Fe3+ and the ammonium seen in current_components. Medium is aerobic photoautotrophic (illuminated 24 h, shaking 150 rpm); target had listed oxygen as facultative reflect"
  },
